A '''Shyworm''' is a {{Common}} [[Critter]] that can be found in the {{Gold|Cavern}} biome of the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}.

== Spawning ==
{{Green|4-8}} '''Shyworms''' spawn in the {{Gold|Cavern}} biome of the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}

== Behavior ==
'''Shyworms''' tunnel through the ground in a square. Upon reaching a corner, they jump out of the ground before landing and continuing to dig. If a '''Shyworm''' sees a player or hears a {{Item|Critter Capsule}} hit a block, it flees. '''Shyworms''' that flee return after {{Green|15}} seconds. If a {{Item|Critter Capsule}} is thrown at a '''Shyworm''' and is caught, it dies and drops its loot.

